  "_comment": "Base item types and the affix table. Affix `ranges` keys use the StatBlock modifier grammar documented in core/stat_block.gd. Affixes never grant `more` modifiers — that bucket belongs to boons, which is what keeps gear build-defining instead of power-defining.",

